            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami w’umugore yaganza i Sheba yumvise ingen’ izina ry’Uhoraho ryahaye Salomo kuba rurangiranwa, aza azanywe no kumugerageresha ibibazo bigoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ashika i Yerusalemu agendaniwe n’abantu benshi b’ isinzi, afise n’ingamiya zīremētse imibavu n’amazahabu menshi cane n’utubuyenge tw’igiciro kinini. Ashitse kwa Salomo amudondorera ivyari mu mutima wiwe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami Salomo amusobanurira ivyo amubajije vyose; nta kintu na kimwe cāmunaniye kw amusobanurira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo mwami w’i Sheba abonye ingene Salomo ar’ umunyabgenge, n’ingoro yubatse ukw imeze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’ivyo kurya vyo ku meza yiwe ukuntu vyari, n’abo mu rugo rwiwe uko bīfata, n’abasuku biwe uko bahēreza, n’ukuntu bambaye, n’abakevyi biwe bamuhēreza igiturire, n’ibimazi vyo kwosa yatanga mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, arajorerwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
