              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ amāto ya Hiramu yahora azana amazahabu ayakūye i Ofiru, yazanana n’ibiti vyinshi cane vyitwa alumugi, n’utubuyenge tw’igiciro kinini, abikūye i Ofiru nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo biti vya alumugi umwami ni vyo yabājemw’ inkingi zo mu ngoro y’Uhoraho n’izo mu ngoro yiwe ubgiwe; yabibājemwo n’inanga n’amakembe vy’abaririmvyi; ntihigeze kuza canke kuboneka ibiti vya alumugi nk’ivyo gushitsa na bugingo n’ubu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami Salomo aha uwo mwami w’i Sheba ivyo yagomba vyose n’ico amwatse cose, udashizemw’ ivyo yagomvye kumwihēra ubgiwe, nk’uk’ umwami ameze nka we asanganywe ikiganza ciza. Bukeye uwo mwami arahaguruka, aragenda asubira mu gihugu ciwe, bo n’abantu biwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
