              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umwami yar’ afise amāto y’i Tarushishi yagendera ku kiyaga yajana n’aya Hiramu; ukw imyaka itatu ishize, ayo māto y’i Tarushishi yagaruka azanye amazahabu n’amafeza n’ amahembe y’inzovu n’inkima n’ ibisīga vyitwa tawusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
